                <td width=572 valign=center colspan=10 style="width:343.6000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;
mso-border-left-alt:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>&nbsp;"Acquired Immunodeficiency Syndrome：Basic and Clinical Science" is an elective medical course offered at Fudan University. It provides a systematic overview of the epidemiology, pathogenesis, clinical diagnosis and treatment, and prevention and control strategies of HIV infection. Integrating global and Chinese epidemiological data, evidence-based findings, and the latest clinical guidelines, the course employs diverse teaching methods such as multimedia instruction, case-based discussions, and flipped classrooms. It aims to cultivate students' clinical reasoning and global perspective in comprehensive HIV/AIDS prevention and care, convey the principles of "patient-centered" practice and international cooperation in addressing pandemics, and foster a spirit of scientific inquiry and humanistic care.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
