border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(255,255,255);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><ol>
<li>Value Guidance</li>
</ol>
<p>Establish correct disease awareness and anti-discrimination consciousness, cultivate patient-centered medical humanistic spirit, and enhance sense of global health responsibility and international collaboration awareness.</p>
<ol start="2">
<li>Knowledge Transfer</li>
</ol>
<p>Systematically master the epidemiology, virology, and immunological mechanisms of HIV infection, as well as clinical diagnosis and treatment, antiretroviral therapy, prevention and treatment of opportunistic infections and associated malignancies.</p>
<ol start="3">
<li>Competency Development</li>
</ol>
<p>Enhance clinical reasoning and evidence-based practice capabilities through case analysis, flipped classrooms, scenario simulations, and other teaching activities, cultivating diagnostic and differential diagnostic skills, physician-patient communication techniques, and interdisciplinary team collaboration abilities.</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
