mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font
                                    face="仿宋">Member of the Academic Committee of Shanghai Medical College, Fudan University; Member of the World Health Organization (WHO) Guidelines Development Groups for COVID-19, Influenza, and Sepsis; Chair elect of the Society of Tropical Diseases and Parasitology, Chinese Medical Association; Standing Committee Member of the Infectious Disease Physicians Branch, Chinese Medical Doctor Association; Member and Secretary of the AIDS and Hepatitis C Study Group, Infectious Diseases Society, Chinese Medical Association; Chair of the HIV Co malignancies Committee, Chinese Association of STD and AIDS Prevention and Control; Vice Chair of the Infectious Diseases Branch, Shanghai Medical Association; Vice President of the Infectious Disease Physicians Branch, Shanghai Medical Doctor Association; Vice Chair of the Antibiotics Committee, Shanghai Pharmaceutical Association.Selected as the Sixth National Outstanding Physician · Excellent Model. Served as Principal Investigator of a major national science and technology project on prevention and control of emerging, re emerging, and major infectious diseases. Received the Third Prize of the Chinese Medical Science and Technology Award in 2021 and 2025 (both as the third awardee), and the Second Prize of the Beijing Science and Technology Progress Award in 2024 (third awardee). Serves on the editorial boards of Viruses and Aging Medicine.</font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
